  "description_html": "Size comparison of the hadrosaurid dinosaur <i>Maiasaura</i>. The midline feature scales are based on those of <i>Brachylophosaurus</i>. The human silhouette is from <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silhouette_of_man_standing_and_facing_forward.svg\" title=\"File:Silhouette of man standing and facing forward.svg\">File:Silhouette of man standing and facing forward.svg</a> (CC0).\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"References\">References</h4></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.skeletaldrawing.com/ornithiscians/maiasaura\"><i>Maiasaura</i> skeletal diagram by Scott Hartman</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.skeletaldrawing.com/ornithiscians/brachylophosaurus\"><i>Brachylophosaurus</i> skeletal reconstruction by Scott Hartman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Leonardo_mummified_brachylophosaurus.jpg\" title=\"File:Leonardo mummified brachylophosaurus.jpg\">Photograph of the <i>Brachylophosaurus</i> specimen nicknamed \"Leonardo\"</a></li></ul>",
